{"id": "sfusd-cafeteria-interest-on-general-fund-support", "title": "SFUSD charged its cafeteria for interest the general fund might have earned", "seconds": 52.8, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-26", "key": "e6d755774c54468f", "words": 146, "beats": [{"scene": "interest", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "When school meal costs exceeded revenue, the district’s general fund covered the difference.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.51, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Why", "did", "the", "cafeteria", "owe", "interest?"], "sub": "San Francisco school meals"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.55, 0.79, 1.27, 1.78, 2.68, 2.85, 3.28, 3.66, 4.08, 4.46, 4.57]}, {"scene": "interest", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The district charged the cafeteria $9,712 in interest that the general fund might otherwise have earned.", "t0": 5.63, "t1": 12.56, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$9,712", "label": "Interest charged to the cafeteria fund"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.58, 0.89, 1.0, 2.11, 2.47, 2.96, 3.26, 3.55, 3.88, 4.27, 4.42, 4.83, 4.98, 5.11, 5.45, 5.76, 5.97, 6.4, 6.55]}, {"scene": "interest", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The State Auditor found that charge unallowable under the federal rules in effect during those years.", "t0": 12.68, "t1": 17.55, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "California State Auditor", "text": "Federal cost rules in the audit period", "mark": "Federal cost rules in the audit period"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.49, 0.92, 1.17, 1.36, 1.78, 2.55, 2.81, 2.92, 3.24, 3.51, 3.6, 3.97, 4.24, 4.47]}, {"scene": "interest", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Auditors also identified $2,509 in salaries and benefits allocated to the wrong fund.", "t0": 17.67, "t1": 23.56, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Unallowable charges in the sample", "heading": "Two corrections", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "money", "label": "Interest", "value": "$9,712"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "Salaries and benefits", "value": "$2,509"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.53, 0.87, 1.34, 1.58, 1.97, 2.22, 2.51, 2.75, 3.14, 3.3, 3.77, 3.9, 4.44, 5.0, 5.11, 5.21, 5.49]}, {"scene": "interest", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The district reported reimbursing the interest and correcting the payroll allocation.", "t0": 23.68, "t1": 27.78, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "California State Auditor", "text": "February 2014 response", "mark": "February 2014 response"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.55, 1.01, 1.63, 1.76, 2.26, 2.48, 2.92, 3.02, 3.44]}, {"scene": "interest", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "It also committed to regular certifications of staff time.", "t0": 27.9, "t1": 30.75, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Review of staff time"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.48, 0.82, 0.96, 1.32, 2.04, 2.15, 2.51]}, {"scene": "hearing", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A Senate hearing had already listed a separate", "t0": 30.97, "t1": 33.37, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "hearing", "kicker": "California Senate Committee on Budget and Fiscal Review", "text": "May 2013 Senate hearing", "mark": "May 2013 Senate hearing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.54, 0.94, 1.15, 1.51, 1.9, 2.01]}, {"scene": "hearing", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "$368,736 cafeteria repayment assessment as closed.", "t0": 33.37, "t1": 39.92, "shot": "assessment", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$368,736", "label": "Repayment assessment"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.31, 0.59, 1.07, 1.92, 2.28, 2.56, 3.08, 3.52, 4.27, 4.7, 5.47, 5.75]}, {"scene": "hearing", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "That hearing